sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant C as Controller
    participant N as NATS JetStream
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant R as Runner
    participant D as Dagger Engine
    participant K as Kubernetes

    Note over C,K: Transition Execution Flow

    rect rgb(240, 253, 244)
        Note right of C: Phase 1: Enable Transition
        C->>N: publish(MarkingUpdated)
        N-->>S: deliver(MarkingUpdated)
        S->>S: Evaluate firing rules
        S->>S: Check guard conditions (CEL)
        S->>S: Verify resource availability
        S->>N: publish(TransitionEnabled)
        N->>S: ack()
    end

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Note right of R: Phase 2: Claim & Fire Transition
        N-->>R: deliver(TransitionEnabled)
        R->>R: Claim transition (atomic)
        R->>N: publish(TransitionFired)
        N->>R: ack()
        N-->>C: deliver(TransitionFired)
        C->>C: Consume input tokens
        C->>N: publish(TokensConsumed)
        N->>C: ack()
    end

    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
        Note right of D: Phase 3: Execute Task
        R->>D: Execute pipeline
        D->>K: Create Pod
        K-->>D: Pod scheduled
        D->>D: Run containers
        Note over D,K: Task execution<br/>(build, test, deploy, etc.)
        K-->>D: Pod completed
        D-->>R: Pipeline result
    end

    rect rgb(243, 232, 255)
        Note right of C: Phase 4: Complete Transition
        alt Success
            R->>N: publish(TransitionCompleted)
            N-->>C: deliver(TransitionCompleted)
            C->>C: Produce output tokens
            C->>N: publish(TokensProduced)
            C->>N: publish(MarkingUpdated)
            Note over S: Scheduler evaluates<br/>next enabled transitions
        else Failure (retryable)
            R->>N: publish(TransitionFailed)
            N-->>C: deliver(TransitionFailed)
            C->>C: Check retry policy
            C->>C: Increment attempt counter
            C->>N: publish(TransitionEnabled)
            Note over R: Runner picks up retry
        else Failure (terminal)
            R->>N: publish(TransitionFailed)
            N-->>C: deliver(TransitionFailed)
            C->>C: Max retries exceeded
            C->>N: publish(WorkflowFailed)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(254, 226, 226)
        Note right of C: Phase 5: Check Completion
        C->>C: Evaluate current marking
        alt Final marking reached
            C->>N: publish(WorkflowCompleted)
        else More work to do
            Note over S: Scheduler continues<br/>enabling transitions
        else Deadlock detected
            C->>N: publish(WorkflowFailed)
            Note over C: No transitions enabled<br/>but not at final marking
        end
    end
